{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月23日，影視颶風創始人Tim（潘天鴻）入駐X平台後發佈第一條內容，賬號關注者已達到<strong>12萬</strong>。目前，該賬號共發佈4條內容，其中一條iPhone Duo測試視頻的帖文瀏覽量已超過<strong>4000萬</strong>，獲得約<strong>1.3萬次轉發、3600條留言</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1583516.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.861238+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:31:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"ebfd3d0741092db7357c7b156aa2b00aea074231deb3ccb7e2a3d0d3dc4f239a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}